WHY CC0

This content is fabricated parametrically from public standards — AISC section tables, ASTM bar
diameters, ASME nominal pipe sizes, IBC and ADA dimensional requirements, and standard trade sizes.
Dimensions of standard manufactured articles are facts, not creative works, so nothing here carries a
third-party redistribution restriction.

No content is copied from BIM object portals. Their terms grant free use *in projects*, not
redistribution, which is why this library generates its own content rather than aggregating theirs.

Every generated IFC type additionally carries its licence in the `MF_Library` property set, so the
declaration travels with the object into any model that imports it.

